<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-GUYANA V INDIA TOSS/TEAMS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GUYANA V INDIA TOSS/TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India won the toss and decided to bat on the opening day of their four-day match against Guyana at Bourda on Friday.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>India - Mohammad Azharuddin (captain), Navjot Sidhu, Ajay Jadeja, Vangipurappu Laxman, Saurav Ganguly, Robin Singh, Sunil joshi, Abey Kuruvilla, Dodanarsiah Ganesh, Noel David, Saba Karim.</p>
<p>Guyana - Shivnarine Chanderpaul (captain), Nicholas Degroot, Rohan Sarjoo, Ramnaresh Sarwan, Zaheer Haniff, Andre Percival, Vishal Nagamootoo, Mahendra Nagamootoo, Neil McGarrel, Reon King, Colin Stuart.</p>
